ished in <i>Andrologia</i>. L-Citrulline at 6g matches the clinical sports performance dosing studied in the <i>Journal of the International Society of Sports Nutrition</i>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If T-boosters felt like nothing and cutting coffee made things worse and TRT feels like a step you're not ready for — none of that means the cycle can't be broken.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;It means everything you tried was targeting the symptom without removing the cause.</p><p>This is built to remove the cause.</p><p>And there is a 21-day money-back guarantee. No return needed. No questions asked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Worst case:</strong> you don't notice a difference and you get every dollar back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Best case: </strong>you fix the actual cause. The second half of every day changes. And it stays.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYOOUOMkOb_text","label":"ggYOOUOMkOb_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:px;\">LIMITED STOCK REMAINING</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHBrWSGCFA_text","label":"ggHBrWSGCFA_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:#D80A0A;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;\"><strong>Current batch 71% Sold</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg29p0aZ1My_text","label":"gg29p0aZ1My_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:#BF1C1C;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;\"><strong>Next run: 5–6 weeks</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Copy_of_Frosted_Files_Volume_3_1080x1080_copy_4_3933a118-20a0-4d2b-ad74-682412167f24.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_tablet_src","label":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_tablet_src","default":"https://placehold.co/1920x1080?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggWBBpos4Zv_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Copy_of_Frosted_Files_Volume_3_1080x1080_copy_4_3933a118-20a